  "details": "# Issue:\n\nBefore Gift Drops were added the VRC+ page filled the menu perfectly. Now there is one extra row that you need to scroll down for with only one button in it.\n\nThis makes the page feel a bit visually unbalanced and uglier if you ask me.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nRemove the `Manage Subscription` Button, this button could easily be removed to solve this visual unbalance, as it does **exactly** the same as clicking on the arrow at the top right.\n\nRemoving it would result in the scroll bar no longer being needed and would *return the page to it's former glory.*\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a screenshot showcasing the issue:",
